0..49 Comment "//! `passed` returns a thunk at its input region."
50..53 Comment "//!"
54..112 Comment "//! The caller reads the returned thunk before that region"
113..139 Comment "//! ends. The pathological"
140..202 Comment "//! twin refuses a result held in no region as `TypeMismatch`."
203..206 Comment "//!"
207..284 Comment "//! `pass` returns its argument unchanged. The `passed` run returns `4`. Rust"
285..350 Comment "//! writes the same lifetime in `fn pass<\'a>(k: &\'a T) -> &\'a T`."
351..354 Comment "//!"
355..437 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/regions/outlived.gandr — a result past its region"
